PN,36801
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FThe sister of a man who has been in
OL,8,Fprison for 14 years with no release
OL,9,Fdate has urged the Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham to review "inhuman"
OL,11,Findeterminate sentences.
OL,13,FThomas White was initially jailed for
OL,14,Fa minimum of two years for stealing a
OL,15,Fmobile phone under an "Imprisonment
OL,16,Ffor Public Protection (IPP) sentence.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FThe sentences, which have since been
OL,8,Fabolished, have no release date and
OL,9,Fthe offender could only be considered
OL,10,Ffor release once the Parole Board
OL,11,Fdecides they are safe to re-enter the
OL,12,Fcommunity.
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has called
OL,15,Ffor a review of the "outdated" IPP
OL,16,Fsentences as part of efforts to tackle
OL,17,Fthe prison overcrowding crisis.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FThomas White, who has additional
OL,8,Fneeds, was convicted of street robbery
OL,9,Fafter stealing a phone in 2012. He
OL,10,Fpleaded guilty and received an IPP
OL,11,Fsentence with a minimum term of two
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,FMr White was diagnosed with paranoid
OL,15,Fschizophrenia in 2016, and Clara said
OL,16,Fa psychiatric report stated that it
OL,17,Fwas "likely because of the
OL,18,Fhopelessness of the IPP sentence" and
OL,19,Fnever knowing if he will be released
OL,20,Fagain.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FA United Nations report determined
OL,8,Fthat these sentences "prolonged
OL,9,Funcertainty and cause serious
OL,10,Fpsychological deterioration among
OL,11,Fprisoners, including an increased risk
OL,12,Fof self-harm and suicide".
OL,14,FUN torture expert Alice Jill Edwards
OL,15,Fsaid: "For many, these sentences have
OL,16,Fbecome cruel, inhuman and degrading."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FThomas' sister Reverend Clara White
OL,8,Fsaid: "He should be a free man because
OL,9,Fthis sentence is, according to the UN,
OL,10,Fan "arbitrary detention. And its
OL,11,Ffindings concluded that this sentence
OL,12,Fis "inhuman torture".
OL,14,FMr White, who is from Bury, has been
OL,15,Ftransferred between at least 13
OL,16,Fprisons and was transferred to a
OL,17,Fpsychiatric hospital in 2025. He is
OL,18,Fset to be returned to prison in the
OL,19,Fcoming weeks.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FClara said he has developed severe
OL,8,Fpsychosis and was "dying in front of
OL,9,Fus" in custody.
OL,11,FRev'd Clara said: "Any day now he will
OL,12,Fbe sent back to a category A or B
OL,13,Fprison in normal population. Thomas is
OL,14,Fgoing to become extremely, extremely
OL,15,Funwell.
OL,17,F"My brother shouldn't even be in a
OL,18,Fforensic psychiatric hospital. And for
OL,19,Fthat matter, he shouldn't even be in a
OL,20,Fcategory A or B prison."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FClara wants Thomas to be released into
OL,8,Fa community psychiatric hospital
OL,9,Fcloser to home where he can have his
OL,10,Ffamily that can "wrap their love
OL,11,Faround him" and then reintegrate him
OL,12,Fback into society.
OL,14,F"Because of this sentence, Thomas is
OL,15,Fnow in what you'd call a prison
OL,16,Fhospital. But any day now, Thomas will
OL,17,Fbe sent back to the mainstream prison.
OL,18,FSo we're sending him back to an
OL,19,Funderstaffed prison, into prisons that
OL,20,Fare up to capacity.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,F"But I'm expected to believe that my
OL,8,Fbrother is going to get better in that
OL,9,Fsituation? Thomas is going to become
OL,10,Fseriously poorly all over again."
OL,12,FIPP sentences are keeping more than
OL,13,F2,300 people behind bars, many of them
OL,14,Flow-level offenders serving an
OL,15,Fabolished sentence. It is estimated to
OL,16,Fcost taxpayers almost #120 million a
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FThey were introduced in 2003 as part
OL,8,Fof the Criminal Justice Act,
OL,9,Foriginally intended to protect the
OL,10,Fpublic from dangerous offenders whose
OL,11,Fcrimes did not merit a life sentence.
OL,13,FThe sentence was abolished in 2012,
OL,14,Fbut this change was not made
OL,15,Fretrospective, and all existing IPPs
OL,16,Fwere at that time still subject to
OL,17,Ftheir sentence.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FA total of 2,329 people remain in
OL,8,Fprison as of May 2026. According to
OL,9,Frecent data, 96 IPP prisoners have
OL,10,Ftaken their own lives in custody since
OL,11,Fthe sentence's inception, in addition
OL,12,Fto 44 people who have been released on
OL,13,Fan IPP licence.
OL,15,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has asked
OL,16,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris to
OL,17,Freview Imprisonment for Public
OL,18,FProtection (IPP) sentences.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FAs part of wider Government's plans to
OL,8,Fease overcrowding in prisons, Andy
OL,9,FBurnham says they will deliver "the
OL,10,Ffastest prison building programme
OL,11,Fsince the Victorian era", aiming to
OL,12,Fcreate 14,000 new prison places by
OL,13,F2031.
OL,26,@qD@`OUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FReverend Clara said: "I think we've
OL,8,Fgot a prime minister with some common
OL,9,Fsense this time. And to find out
OL,10,Fyesterday that the prime minister has
OL,11,Fasked the justice secretary to look at
OL,12,FIPP's is probably for me and many
OL,13,Fother families, is some kind of nice
OL,14,Flight that you've not seen. Families
OL,15,Fhave been met with nothing but
OL,16,Fdarkness in this for many years.
OL,18,F"We have set our dreams high before to
OL,19,Fthen wake to a nightmare that
OL,20,Fnothing's going to be done for IPP men
OL,21,Fand women in custody," she added.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,F"My message to the prime minister
OL,8,Fwould be to go another couple of steps
OL,9,Fforward and retrospectively abolish
OL,10,Fthis sentence, save lives once and for
OL,11,Fall and get rid of this sentence.
OL,13,F"We're not standing down. We're going
OL,14,Fto keep going until our family and the
OL,15,Fother families get justice for their
OL,16,Ffamilies too."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786038506
OL,3,CSister of man jailed 14 years for
OL,4,Cphone theft urges PM to review IPP
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FA Government spokesperson said: "It is
OL,8,Fright that these sentences were
OL,9,Fabolished, and as the IPP annual
OL,10,Freport shows, support has
OL,11,Fsignificantly improved for these
OL,12,Foffenders, with greater access to
OL,13,Frehabilitation and mental health
OL,14,Fsupport. We are now looking at what
OL,15,Fmore can be done."
OL,17,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,18,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,19,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,20,Four region.
OL,26,@oD@aOUwD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/14
